en.Rina_Skill_AssaultAid_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> after an <color=#FFFFFF>Evasive Assist</color> to activate:
Order Drusilla and Anastella to push forward and generate an electrical vortex, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Can quickly chain into <color=#FFFFFF>[Enhanced Special: Fool Vanishing Magic]</color> during this skill;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Sigrid_MathSkill_Desc:
Triggers when your squad has a <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> character:
Upon triggering, DMG dealt by this character increases by 600%;
When an attack hits an enemy afflicted with Wind Contamination, DMG dealt by this character increases by <color=#FFFFFF>15%</color>

en.Sigrid_Skill_Branch_Desc:
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Roaming Stance]</color> with available <color=#FFFFFF>[Gun Retraction]</color> counts, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Activates the corresponding <color=#FFFFFF>[Gun Retraction]</color> based on the current segment, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Gun Retraction]</color> has 3 segments in total, and each use advances the segment count;
Using Gun Retraction after a Basic Attack preserves the Basic Attack segment count;
DMG taken is reduced by 60% during this skill;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

en.Sigrid_Skill_Counter_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> to activate:
Condenses ice at the gun's tip to deliver a powerful counter against enemies ahead, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Triggering a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> and launching a Dodge Counter during a Basic Attack preserves the current Basic Attack chain;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Draw Stance</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Sigrid_Skill_Evade_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Sigrid_Skill_ExQTE_Desc:
When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Channels the power of extreme cold to unleash a devastating series of dashes forward, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Draw</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Sigrid_Skill_Normal_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch up to 4 Slashes forward, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> Stage 4 is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Drawn Stance]</color>;

en.Sigrid_Skill_QTE_Desc:
When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launch a powerful Pierce against enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color>. Each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color> increases the DMG dealt by subsequent Retract Stance by 20%, stacking up to 2 times. <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color> are removed after the 3rd Retract Stance ends;
When this skill hits an elite or Boss-Rank enemy in Daze for the first time, the current <color=#FFFFFF>[Retract Stance]</color> stage is recorded and <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> is activated. This effect can trigger at most once per Daze;
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Aerial Gunstance]</color> duration does not decrease, and holding <IconMap:Icon_Normal> allows continuous use of Retract Stance from Stage 1 through Stage 3;
After activating the 3rd stage of <color=#FFFFFF>[Retract Stance]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> ends and the <color=#FFFFFF>[Retract Stance]</color> stage is restored;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Draw Stance]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Tsubaki_Skill_EvadeSpecial_Desc:
When Nekomata has <color=#FFFFFF>40</color> or more [Purr Energy], after triggering <color=#FFFFFF>[Perfect Dodge]</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to consume 30 [Purr Energy] and activate:
Nekomata enters Vital View and quickly dashes behind the enemy;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill, and this skill does not consume dodge charges;

en.Tsubaki_Skill_ExSpecial_EvadeSpecialBran:
After using <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge: Vanishing Tail Technique]</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> when having 40 or more [Purr Energy] to activate:
Launch a powerful Slash against enemies in a large area ahead, dealing massive <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Tsubaki_Skill_Special_Enhance_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Unleashes a downward strike, dealing <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill;
The skill's follow-up attack effect is enhanced.

en.Weapon_TalentDes_81415911:
When the equipper lands a Heavy Strike using <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, they gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color>. <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color> stacks up to 2 times, with each skill type providing at most 1 stack. Each stack increases CRIT DMG by <color=#2BAD00>32%</color>, lasting 25s;
Using the aforementioned skills refreshes the duration of <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color>;
When the equipper has 2 stacks of <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color>, they gain <color=#FFFFFF>[Bone-Piercing]</color>: <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG dealt is increased by <color=#2BAD00>0%</color></color>, and ignores 20% of the target's <color=#98EFF0>Ice RES</color>.

